  "extmetadata": {
   "ImageDescription": "<p>The Bajaj Pulsar 200NS is a sports bike made by Bajaj Auto. The NS stands for Naked Sport. The Pulsar 200NS has a single-cylinder, four-stroke, triple spark-ignition &amp; liquid-cooled engine. It uses a pressed steel perimeter frame and a box section swingarm, an underbelly exhaust, and rear nitrox-charged mono-shock suspension.\n</p>\nspecks :<a class=\"external free\" href=\"https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bajaj_Pulsar_200NS\">https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bajaj_Pulsar_200NS</a>",
