  "wikitext": "== {{int:filedesc}} ==\n{{Information\n|description=The Bajaj Pulsar 200NS is a sports bike made by Bajaj Auto. The NS stands for Naked Sport. The Pulsar 200NS has a single-cylinder, four-stroke, triple spark-ignition & liquid-cooled engine. It uses a pressed steel perimeter frame and a box section swingarm, an underbelly exhaust, and rear nitrox-charged mono-shock suspension.\n\nspecks :https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bajaj_Pulsar_200NS\n|source={{own}}\n|author=[[User:Sankar 1995|Sankar 1995]]\n|date={{According to EXIF data|2017-09-19}}\n}}\n== {{int:license-header}} ==\n{{self|cc-by-sa-3.0}}\n\n{{Uploaded from Mobile|platform=Android|version=2.4.2}}\n[[Category:Bajaj Pulsar]]",
